[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11584.309, "timestamp": "03:13:04", "text": "专注于此。所以不会有呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11588.389, "timestamp": "03:13:08", "text": "不会有适当的……呃……分开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11590.87, "timestamp": "03:13:10", "text": "直播之类的，或者像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11593.03, "timestamp": "03:13:13", "text": "我一直在使用的播放列表流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11595.75, "timestamp": "03:13:15", "text": "在 YouTube 上做这些事等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11599.269, "timestamp": "03:13:19", "text": "年。这将只是一次特殊事件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11604.389, "timestamp": "03:13:24", "text": "所以，我的频道将完全是关于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11606.63, "timestamp": "03:13:26", "text": "这次事件。我想如果我在直播的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11610.63, "timestamp": "03:13:30", "text": "每天都是如此，天知道持续了多久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11614.309, "timestamp": "03:13:34", "text": "是的，我的确有一些激励措施。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11617.03, "timestamp": "03:13:37", "text": "心中已有目标或内容创意。我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11620.309, "timestamp": "03:13:40", "text": "照做。而且它具有适应性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11623.269, "timestamp": "03:13:43", "text": "因为我要做四个月。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11625.91, "timestamp": "03:13:45", "text": "这将赋予你们自由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11629.19, "timestamp": "03:13:49", "text": "呃，你知道，就是转轮盘什么的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11632.71, "timestamp": "03:13:52", "text": "作为激励措施"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11636.63, "timestamp": "03:13:56", "text": "或者惩罚之类的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11638.71, "timestamp": "03:13:58", "text": "是的"}]